window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In the world of Myrtlewood, magic isn't just a myth—it's a birthright.</b></p> <p>It's Christmas Eve, and Delia's family is finally together again. All is quiet and still, yet Delia can't help but feel a sense of foreboding. After all, an ancient dragon has just awakened and stronger magic is pulsing through the veins of the Myrtlewood Crones.</p> <p>Delia braces herself for her most enchanting adventure yet as questions about her grandmother's mysterious death and her heritage haunt her. On top of all this, her daughter Gillian's strange behavior becomes even more unsettling and the spirited grandchildren tumble into the mix.</p> <p>Every new revelation pushes the Crones closer to danger as they work to unlock their deeper powers. Delia is now more determined than ever to confront the mysteries that threaten her family and confront the past. Dive headfirst into a whirlwind of magic, betrayals, and family secrets!</p>"; 
